  "statement_html": "Cliquez sur les bonnes réponses.\t<div class=\"wims_instruction\">Une seule bonne réponse par question.</div>\t<table class=\"wimscenter wimsborder\">\t<tr><th>QUESTIONS</th><th>A</th>\t<th>B</th><th>C</th>\t<th>D</th></tr>\t<tr><td>SABCD est une pyramide à base carrée ABCD et de sommet S. <div class=\"wimscenter\"><img src=\"/api/static/H3/algebra/oefqcm3.fr/images/pyramide.png\" alt=\"\"></div>Le triangle ABC est :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"1\">rectangle &#44; non isocèle</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"2\">rectangle et isocèle</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"3\">isocèle &#44; non rectangle</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"4\">ni rectangle &#44; ni isocèle</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>On coupe la pyramide précédente par un plan parallèle à sa base. La section obtenue est un :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"1\">carré</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"2\">rectangle non carré</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"3\">parallélogramme non rectangle</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"4\">triangle isocèle</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>Un cylindre de révolution a pour rayon 3 cm et pour hauteur 10 cm. <br> Le volume de ce cylindre &#44; exprimé en \\(\\large cm^3\\) &#44; est :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"1\">\\(\\large 20 \\pi\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"2\">\\(\\large 90 \\pi\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"3\">\\(\\large 30 \\pi\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"4\">\\(\\large 10 \\pi\\)</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td>Un rectangle A'B'C'D' d'aire \\(\\large 24 ~cm^2\\) est l'agrandissement à l'échelle \\(\\large 1,25\\) d'un rectangle ABCD. <br>L'aire du rectangle ABCD &#44; exprimée en \\(\\large cm^2\\) &#44; est :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"1\">\\(\\large 19,2\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"2\">\\(\\large 30\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"3\">\\(\\large 15,36\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply4\" data-pos=\"4\">\\(\\large 37,5\\)</span></td> </tr>\t<tr><td><div class=\"wimscenter\"><img src=\"/api/static/H3/algebra/oefqcm3.fr/images/trianglerect4.png\" alt=\"\"></div>La valeur exacte de EG est :</td>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"1\">\\(\\large 3 \\sqrt{2}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"2\">\\(\\large 4 \\sqrt{2}\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"3\">\\(\\large 18\\)</span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply5\" data-pos=\"4\">\\(\\large 2 \\sqrt{3}\\)</span></td> </tr>\t</table>",
